@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>This MVC webpage application was developed by Dylan Wuu as a Final Project for the TrueCoders Flex Course. <br>
   You can view the GitHub repository <a href="https://github.com/dwuu10/BeanPriceViewer/tree/Work" target="_blank">here</a>. <br>
   <br>
   This application is complementary to a Console App game that can be found  <a href="https://github.com/dwuu10/FinalProject_Beans/tree/Backend-Work" target="_blank">here</a>. <br>
</p>
<p>
   This application makes use of the OpenWeatherMap API to calculate the hypothetical Bean prices for the aforementioned Console App game. <br>
   If you are having difficulties finding your desired city please refer to <a href="https://openweathermap.org/" target="_blank">OpenWeatherMap's website</a>  to make sure it is included in the API.
</p>
<p>
    The game can be accessed in the "Game" tab in the top bar <br>
    <br>
    You can start a new game or play an existing one saved <br>
    <br>
    When creating a new game, you can set the starting cash and number of turns you wish to play to (default cash: 1000, default turns: 20) <br>
    <br>
    In game, you are able to buy/sell beans at any cities you have saved <br>
    <br>
    Each turn, you can perform a single purchase/sale order at a city of your choosing <br>
    <br>
    Prices at each city will update at the beginning of each turn <br>
    <br>
    Have fun trying to earn as much cash as you can! <br>
</p>
